{"seq":2,"slug":"chat-system","title":"聊天系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/case-studies/chat-system","wordCount":642,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"聊天系统\">聊天系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>聊天系统是长连接与可靠投递的典型场景，200 亿条/日的消息量与 &lt; 200ms 的延迟要求决定了它以推送而非拉取为主。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>长连接管理</strong>：客户端通过 WebSocket 握手 + 认证 Token 建连，网关把 userId → gatewayId:connId 注册到共享连接注册表（Redis），断连时移除。</li>\n<li><strong>消息发送流程</strong>：先持久化再投递——在线走消息队列路由到对端网关推送，离线走 APNs/FCM 推送通知。</li>\n<li><strong>存储选型</strong>：消息写入密集且按会话时序查询，Cassandra 以 conversation_id 为分区键、message_id（TimeUUID）为聚簇键，天然有序。</li>\n<li><strong>群聊扇出</strong>：小群（≤100 人）用写扩散（推模式，实时推送每个在线成员），大群用读扩散（拉模式，只存一份成员主动拉取）。</li>\n<li><strong>在线状态</strong>：靠心跳（每 30 秒）维护，超时（60 秒无心跳）判定离线并推送给好友，状态存于 Redis。</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性保障</strong>：消息持久化 + ACK 确认 + 离线消息同步三者缺一不可。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"需求分析\">需求分析</h2><p>设计一个类似微信/WhatsApp 的即时聊天系统，支持一对一聊天和群聊。</p>\n<h3 id=\"功能需求\">功能需求</h3><ul>\n<li>一对一聊天：实时发送和接收文本消息</li>\n<li>群聊：支持最多 500 人的群组</li>\n<li>在线状态：显示用户是否在线</li>\n<li>消息已读回执</li>\n<li>离线消息：用户上线后接收离线期间的消息</li>\n<li>消息历史：可以查看历史消息</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"非功能需求\">非功能需求</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日活用户</td>\n<td>5000 万</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每日消息量</td>\n<td>200 亿条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息延迟</td>\n<td>&lt; 200ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>99.99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息持久化</td>\n<td>永久保存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"高层架构\">高层架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Client1[客户端 A] &lt;--&gt;|WebSocket| GW1[WebSocket 网关]&#10;    Client2[客户端 B] &lt;--&gt;|WebSocket| GW2[WebSocket 网关]&#10;&#10;    GW1 --&gt; ChatSvc[聊天服务]&#10;    GW2 --&gt; ChatSvc&#10;&#10;    ChatSvc --&gt; MQ[消息队列]&#10;    ChatSvc --&gt; UserSvc[用户/在线状态服务]&#10;    ChatSvc --&gt; MsgStore[(消息存储)]&#10;&#10;    MQ --&gt; Push[推送服务]&#10;    Push --&gt; GW1&#10;    Push --&gt; GW2&#10;    Push --&gt; APNs[APNs/FCM&lt;br/&gt;离线推送]\">flowchart TB\n    Client1[客户端 A] &lt;--&gt;|WebSocket| GW1[WebSocket 网关]\n    Client2[客户端 B] &lt;--&gt;|WebSocket| GW2[WebSocket 网关]\n\n    GW1 --&gt; ChatSvc[聊天服务]\n    GW2 --&gt; ChatSvc\n\n    ChatSvc --&gt; MQ[消息队列]\n    ChatSvc --&gt; UserSvc[用户/在线状态服务]\n    ChatSvc --&gt; MsgStore[(消息存储)]\n\n    MQ --&gt; Push[推送服务]\n    Push --&gt; GW1\n    Push --&gt; GW2\n    Push --&gt; APNs[APNs/FCM&lt;br/&gt;离线推送]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"详细设计\">详细设计</h2><h3 id=\"websocket-连接管理\">WebSocket 连接管理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant GW as WebSocket 网关&#10;    participant Registry as 连接注册表&#10;    participant Chat as 聊天服务&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;GW: WebSocket 握手 + 认证 Token&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 验证 Token&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;Registry: 注册 userId → gatewayId:connId&#10;    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 连接建立&#10;&#10;    loop 心跳&#10;        C-&gt;&gt;GW: Ping&#10;        GW--&gt;&gt;C: Pong&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;GW: 断开连接&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;Registry: 移除注册\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant GW as WebSocket 网关\n    participant Registry as 连接注册表\n    participant Chat as 聊天服务\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;GW: WebSocket 握手 + 认证 Token\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 验证 Token\n    GW-&gt;&gt;Registry: 注册 userId → gatewayId:connId\n    GW--&gt;&gt;C: 连接建立\n\n    loop 心跳\n        C-&gt;&gt;GW: Ping\n        GW--&gt;&gt;C: Pong\n    end\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;GW: 断开连接\n    GW-&gt;&gt;Registry: 移除注册</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ConnectionRegistry {&#10;  register(userId: string, gatewayId: string, connectionId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  unregister(userId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  lookup(userId: string): Promise&lt;{ gatewayId: string; connectionId: string } | null&gt;;&#10;  isOnline(userId: string): Promise&lt;boolean&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class RedisConnectionRegistry implements ConnectionRegistry {&#10;  constructor(private redis: RedisClient) {}&#10;&#10;  async register(userId: string, gatewayId: string, connectionId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    await this.redis.hset(`conn:${userId}`, { gatewayId, connectionId });&#10;    await this.redis.expire(`conn:${userId}`, 300);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async unregister(userId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    await this.redis.del(`conn:${userId}`);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async lookup(userId: string): Promise&lt;{ gatewayId: string; connectionId: string } | null&gt; {&#10;    const data = await this.redis.hgetall(`conn:${userId}`);&#10;    if (!data || !data.gatewayId) return null;&#10;    return { gatewayId: data.gatewayId, connectionId: data.connectionId };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  async isOnline(userId: string): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;    return (await this.redis.exists(`conn:${userId}`)) === 1;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RedisClient {&#10;  hset(key: string, data: Record&lt;string, string&gt;): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  hgetall(key: string): Promise&lt;Record&lt;string, string&gt; | null&gt;;&#10;  del(key: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  expire(key: string, seconds: number): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  exists(key: string): Promise&lt;number&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConnectionRegistry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gatewayId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">connectionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  unregister</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  lookup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark: